# `ots upgrade` writes a .bak of the pre-upgrade proof beside each file it
# upgrades. The upgraded proof is a strict superset: same commitment, plus
# the Bitcoin attestation. The backup is transient noise, and shipping it
# would put two proofs for one file in the tree with nothing saying which
# is current. Deleted after every upgrade, ignored so it cannot slip in.
*.ots.bak
